/* ================= CAMPAIGN — CASES 002–005 (all fictional) =================

   One connected case arc. Elias Voss (Voss Import Parts) runs a theft ring:

   his night-delivery operation hits the QuickMart (002), threatens the one

   witness who photographed it (003), stages the goods through the Harbor

   Freight warehouse using driver Doyle Ferris (004), and stores the take in

   Boat Shed B for the freighter Gray Gull (005). Every link is established

   by evidence or statements in earlier missions before the finale uses it. */

